<p>You touch the target with your psiblade, bringing the forces of nature to bear on your foe.</p><p>Thorny vines will grab the target, slowing it by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">16%, 25%, 31%, 36%, 40%</acronym> and dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">15, 21, 25, 28, 31</acronym> nature damage each turn for 10 turns.</p><p>Damage will increase with your Mindpower and Mindstar power (requires two mindstars, multiplier  1).</p>